"<p><b>Error recognition</b></p>"
"<p>Here you can set how to show that an error occurred. <b>Beep on error</b>"
" beeps and <b>Change text color on error</b> changes the color of the "
"translated text. If none is activated, you will still see a message in the "
"statusbar.</p></qt>"
